# Example API key file.
#
# Copy this to `secrets/api_key` and point `EAS_WEATHER_RS__WEBSERVER__API_KEY_FILE`
# at it to enable API-key auth on the configuration endpoints. `secrets/api_key`
# is gitignored; commit only this `.example` file.
#
# For local development a sample key is also provided in the repo root at
# `test_key`.
